title: "Measuring Foreign Exposure — Replication Package"
abstract: "Replication code (MATLAB, Stata, Python) for Imbs and Pauwels (2025), \"Measuring Foreign Exposure,\" Journal of International Economics. Reproduces every figure and table in the paper. The underlying WIOD and IMF data are archived separately (see identifiers)."
